{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53163","headline":"答复礼禅师《真妄偈》（题拟） · 澄观","name":"答复礼禅师《真妄偈》（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迷真妄念生，悟真妄即止。\n能迷非常迷，安得长相似。\n从来未曾悟，故说妄无始。\n知妄本自真，方是恒妙理。\n分别心未忘，何由出生死。\n（《林间录》卷上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"澄观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}